<title>FT 报道 OpenAI 预计 2030 年前累计现金消耗约 $278B / FT just reported， OpenAI expects its spending to far exceed revenue， even as revenue is forecast to …</title>
<link>https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2101095915654463533</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2101095915654463533</guid>
<description>FT 报道，OpenAI 预计支出将远超收入，营收预计从今年的 $36B 增至 2030 年的 $350B。2026 至 2030 年总营收约 $840B，算力支出约 $856B，累计现金消耗约 $278B。（X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)）</description>
